## 💡 Tips for Success

- **Start with Bug #5** (Supabase errors) - Affects user experience most
- **Then Bug #1** (race condition) - Critical for UX stability  
- **Then Bug #4** (XSS) - Security fix
- **Then Bug #2** (memory leak) - Performance
- **Then Bug #3** (language handling) - UX polish

- **Test each fix individually** in browser before moving to next
- **Use browser DevTools (F12)** to verify console logs are clean
- **Check all 4 languages** at least once per fix
- **Keep the Supabase fallback working** - test offline mode

