## ⚡ Quick Commands to Get Started

```bash
# Clone and setup
git clone https://github.com/MDynasty/Wykta.git
cd Wykta

# Create feature branch for first bug fix
git checkout -b fix/supabase-error-handling

# Open in Cursor
cursor .

# After fixes, push
git add -A
git commit -m "fix: add error notifications for Supabase failures"
git push origin fix/supabase-error-handling

# Create PR on GitHub
```

